{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2015-common-biology-28","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2015,"subject":"biology","number":28,"points":2,"unitId":"renal","unitLabel":"배설·체액 조절","topic":"세뇨관·이눌린·오줌","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["renal","circulation"],"stem":"표는 어떤 사람의 혈장과 오줌에서 측정한 PAH와 이눌린의 \n농도를 나타낸 것이다. PAH는 혈장에서 완전히 제거되며, 이눌린은\n세뇨관을 통한 분비와 재흡수가 일어나지 않는다.\n혈장(mg/mL)\n오줌(mg/mL)\nPAH\n0.04\n16\n이눌린\n0.02\n1\n(오줌의 배출량: 2 mL/min, 혈구용적: 50%)\n이에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것만을 <보기>에서 있는 대로 고른 것은?\n<보 기>\nㄱ. 사구체 여과율(glomerular filtration rate, GFR)은 100 mL/min\n이다.\nㄴ. 신혈장류량(renal plasma flow, RPF)은 400 mL/min이다.\nㄷ. 신혈류량(renal blood flow, RBF)은 800 mL/min이다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t019"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t020"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t021"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t022"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t023"]}],"answer":1,"acceptedAnswers":[1],"answerStatus":"source-text","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":776,"height":152,"region":0,"bbox":[14.28,65.703,310.4,60.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2015-common-biology-28/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":776,"height":229,"region":0,"bbox":[14.28,190.103,310.4,91.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t014","t015","t016","t017","t018"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2015-common-biology-28/02.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":15,"sourceRect":[430.12,152.297,759.1,465.262],"width":328.98,"height":312.965,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[14.28,65.703,310.4,60.8],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bbox":[14.28,190.103,310.4,91.6],"sectio